10.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne changing the zoning classification from County CB Community Business and
County A-2 Agricultural to CB Community Business, AG Agricultural, and LI Light
Industrial for land located between Clear Creek Parkway and South Greeley Highway,
south of College Drive.

ACTION:

11.
