5, Business Licenses and Regulations, of the Municipal Code of the City of Cheyenne,
Wyoming, amending provisions governing the possession of alcoholic liquor or malt
beverages in an open container as specified.  (SPONSOR – MR. JOHNSON)

ACTION:

